# Variables: token = MC_TOKEN de backend/.env
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080/master-control
@token = pega-aqui-tu-MC_TOKEN

### GET actions
GET {{base}}/actions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Obtener acción por ID
GET {{base}}/actions/open_vscode
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Ejecutar VSCode
POST {{base}}/actions/open_vscode/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eliminar acción
DELETE {{base}}/actions/open_vscode
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear una acción tipo command
POST {{base}}/actions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "open_vscode",
  "label": "Abrir VSCode",
  "icon": "vscode.png",
  "type": "command",
  "command": "open -a 'Visual Studio Code'"
}


### Crear una acción tipo AppleScript (ctrl+tab)
POST {{base}}/actions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "next_tab",
  "label": "Next Tab",
  "icon": "tab.png",
  "type": "applescript",
  "command": "tell application \"System Events\" to key code 48 using control down"
}

### Crear acción scroll simple (flecha abajo repetida)
POST {{base}}/actions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "scroll_down",
  "label": "Scroll Down",
  "icon": "scroll.png",
  "type": "applescript",
  "command": "repeat 10 times tell application \\\"System Events\\\" to key code 125 end repeat"
}

### Acción con salida, confirmación y timeout propio
POST {{base}}/actions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "disk_usage",
  "label": "Disco",
  "icon": "💾",
  "type": "command",
  "command": "df -h /",
  "show_output": true,
  "confirm": false,
  "timeout_seconds": 5
}

### Ejecutar y ver la salida (ok, exit_code, stdout, stderr, duration_ms, timed_out, truncated)
POST {{base}}/actions/disk_usage/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
